# Pre-push / post-push GitHub checks

Repo: [Marfa/google-large-photo-revomer](https://github.com/Marfa/google-large-photo-revomer).

## Before every `git push`

1. **Open PRs** — review and handle https://github.com/Marfa/google-large-photo-revomer/pulls  
   (`gh pr list`, review/merge/close/comment as needed; do not leave blocking open work ignored).

2. **Security alerts** — check and process all of:
   - https://github.com/Marfa/google-large-photo-revomer/security/malware
   - https://github.com/Marfa/google-large-photo-revomer/security/dependabot
   - https://github.com/Marfa/google-large-photo-revomer/security/code-scanning
   - https://github.com/Marfa/google-large-photo-revomer/security/secret-scanning  
   (`gh api` alerts; fix code, bump deps, dismiss with reason, or open fix PR).

Do not push until open PRs and security alerts are consciously handled (fixed, merged, or explicitly deferred with a note to the user).

## After every `git push`

1. Watch https://github.com/Marfa/google-large-photo-revomer/actions (`gh run list` / `gh run watch`).
2. Drive failed workflows to **green**: read failed logs, fix root cause, push follow-up, re-check until Actions succeed (or report a blocker that needs the user).

## Commands (typical)

```bash
gh pr list --repo Marfa/google-large-photo-revomer
gh api "/repos/Marfa/google-large-photo-revomer/dependabot/alerts?state=open"
gh api "/repos/Marfa/google-large-photo-revomer/code-scanning/alerts?state=open"
gh api "/repos/Marfa/google-large-photo-revomer/secret-scanning/alerts?state=open"
gh run list --repo Marfa/google-large-photo-revomer --limit 10
gh run watch <run-id> --repo Marfa/google-large-photo-revomer
gh run view <run-id> --repo Marfa/google-large-photo-revomer --log-failed
```
